Subject: [PATCH] perf: optimize Yuanrong backend operations

Use Yuanrong multi-buffer and batch existence APIs, remove redundant key normalization, and add phase latency metrics for backend preparation costs.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
